POINT 5: UIBACKGROUNDMODES LOCATION\
\
Apple's Note:\
\
"The app declares support for location in the UIBackgroundModes key in your Info.plist file but we are unable to locate any features that require persistent location. Apps that declare support for location in the UIBackgroundModes key must have features that require persistent location."\
\
What we did:\
\
Removed location from UIBackgroundModes in Info.plist. Left only remote-notification for push notifications. The app uses Significant-Change Location Service and Region Monitoring for parental control features, which do not require persistent location updates according to Apple documentation.\
\
Result:\
\
UIBackgroundModes location:\
We removed location from UIBackgroundModes because the app uses location tracking methods that do not require persistent location updates.\
\
Explanation of method usage:\
\
The app uses the following methods for parental control features:\
1. Significant-Change Location Service \'97 updates when location changes by 500+ meters. This method does not require location in UIBackgroundModes because updates occur only with significant location changes, not continuously.\
\
2. Region Monitoring \'97 tracking entry/exit from geofences (home, school, activities). This method also does not require location in UIBackgroundModes because iOS automatically tracks regions in the background.\
\
Parental control features using location:\
- Tracking children's location (via Significant-Change Location Service)\
- Geofences (home, school, activities) \'97 via Region Monitoring\
- Movement history\
- Movement notifications\
- SOS button for emergencies\
\
Technical implementation:\
- The app uses NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription to obtain location when the app is active\
- For background tracking, Significant-Change Location Service is used (updates only with significant location changes, 500+ meters)\
- For geofences, Region Monitoring is used (updates on entry/exit from zones)\
- Both methods work in the background without requiring location in UIBackgroundModes\
\
Code changes:\
- Info.plist \'97 removed location string from UIBackgroundModes\
- UIBackgroundModes now contains only remote-notification for push notifications\
